## Mixed into a sentence
An image can also sit inline, ![a small inline icon](data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCA0MCA0MCI+PGNpcmNsZSBjeD0iMjAiIGN5PSIyMCIgcj0iMTgiIGZpbGw9IiM1YjU0ZDYiLz48L3N2Zz4=) right beside the words around it, at a small size rather than a full figure.
